        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Vindictive Crush"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The hatred siktempora has a creature grabbed\n\nFrequency: 1/round\n\nThe hatred siktempora tightens their garrote, dealing 5d10 bludgeoning damage to each creature they're Grabbing. Each creature grabbed by the siktempora must attempt a 40 Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature takes no damage.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and can't breathe or speak while it remains grabbed; it must hold its breath or begin suffocating.\n- **Critical Failure:** As failure, but double damage and the creature becomes restrained and can't speak for 1 round after it's no longer grabbed."
            },
